# Flight volume vs glass visual

- `DroneFlight Volume` is collider-only for drone bounds (no visible mesh renderer requirement).
- `LimitedDroneEmulator.flightVolume` should reference `DroneFlight Volume`'s `BoxCollider`.
- `GlassBox Visual` is the visible glass mesh and should hold the glass material.
- Avoid duplicating trigger colliders across both objects unless intentionally needed.
- Keep naming clear (`DroneFlight Volume`, `GlassBox Visual`) to avoid wiring mistakes.
